        {"zh": "伤口疼痛，孤独难耐。", "en": "Wound hurts, lonely."},
        {"zh": "受伤了，渴望治愈。", "en": "Injured, hoping to be healed."},
        {"zh": "伤口渗血，冷清难耐。", "en": "Wound bleeding, feeling cold."},
